  "The file's https address, its size and its SHA-256, separated by spaces:\nhttps://huggingface.co/org/repo/resolve/main/model.gguf 2497000000 <sha256>\nA Hugging Face file may leave out the hash; the client then takes it from the host.": "檔案的 https 位址、大小與 SHA-256，以空格分隔：\nhttps://huggingface.co/org/repo/resolve/main/model.gguf 2497000000 <sha256>\nHugging Face 檔案可省略雜湊值；用戶端會從主機取得。",
  "The first file is the one the engine loads; a vision model's projector (mmproj*.gguf) goes beside it. An upload is hashed here and checked by the server; a file hosted elsewhere needs its https address, its size and its SHA-256 (a Hugging Face file may leave the hash to the host).": "第一個檔案是引擎要載入的檔案；視覺模型的投影器 (mmproj*.gguf) 放在其旁邊。上傳的檔案會在此計算雜湊並由伺服器檢查；託管於他處的檔案需要其 https 位址、大小與 SHA-256（Hugging Face 檔案可將雜湊交由主機提供）。",
  "The inference engines clients download, one bundle per platform and accelerator, as the gallery index carries them. Only a super administrator changes them.": "用戶端下載的推論引擎，每個平台與加速器一個套件包，如資源庫索引所載。只有超級管理員可變更。",
